  "reasoning": "The ordinary generic Peptone owner is supported as exact mesh:D010461 Peptones under native section3. NLM explicitly supplies Peptone and its conventional partial-hydrolysate material definition, independently consistent with the manufacturer generic description. Earlier process/precipitation and FoodOn use-gate interpretations were overstated; no actual contrary assigned preparation is established. Exact generic identity does not determine either frozen source assay supplier or approve its organism role. Preserve both observations, plural/raw provenance, truncated-token rejection, all source/role/owner/export holds and separately authored component dependencies.",
  "applicability": "Full final materials reassessment, case 173: The two MicrobeDecoder peptones observations do not establish mammalian origin. Retain generic Peptone registry identity, preserve the plural and assay holds, and reject the incomplete Peptone (0.01 % identity token without reconstructing a concentration. The 18 original retained inbound references and current coupled component proposals require separate source-level reconciliation, never automatic retargeting.",
